  <!-- 고대 유적 전용 연쇄 붕괴 크림 벽: 살덩이처럼 파괴 시 연결된 일부분이 함께 무너진다 -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="BuildingBase">
    <defName>VV_RuinCreamWall</defName>
    <label>hardened cream wall</label>
    <description>A vivicream wall that seems to have been hastily put up long ago and left to harden. Because of its unstable structure, breaking one section causes nearby connected chunks to collapse with it.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Building/Linked/RockFlecked_Atlas</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <linkType>CornerFiller</linkType>
      <linkFlags>
        <li>Wall</li>
      </linkFlags>
      <shaderType>CutoutComplex</shaderType>
      <color>(0.98, 0.88, 0.68, 1.0)</color>
      <colorTwo>(1.0, 0.97, 0.88, 1.0)</colorTwo>
      <damageData>
        <cornerTL>Damage/Corner</cornerTL>
        <cornerTR>Damage/Corner</cornerTR>
        <cornerBL>Damage/Corner</cornerBL>
        <cornerBR>Damage/Corner</cornerBR>
        <edgeTop>Damage/Edge</edgeTop>
        <edgeBot>Damage/Edge</edgeBot>
        <edgeLeft>Damage/Edge</edgeLeft>
        <edgeRight>Damage/Edge</edgeRight>
      </damageData>
    </graphicData>
    <altitudeLayer>Building</altitudeLayer>
    <passability>Impassable</passability>
    <blockWind>true</blockWind>
    <castEdgeShadows>true</castEdgeShadows>
    <fillPercent>1</fillPercent>
    <coversFloor>true</coversFloor>
    <rotatable>false</rotatable>
    <terrainAffordanceNeeded>Light</terrainAffordanceNeeded>
    <holdsRoof>true</holdsRoof>
    <staticSunShadowHeight>1.0</staticSunShadowHeight>
    <blockLight>true</blockLight>
    <leaveResourcesWhenKilled>false</leaveResourcesWhenKilled>
    <autoTargetNearbyIdenticalThings>true</autoTargetNearbyIdenticalThings>
    <soundImpactDefault>BulletImpact_Ground</soundImpactDefault>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>45</MaxHitPoints>
      <Flammability>0.8</Flammability>
      <Beauty>-2</Beauty>
    </statBases>
    <building>
      <isInert>true</isInert>
      <claimable>false</claimable>
      <deconstructible>false</deconstructible>
      <repairable>false</repairable>
      <quickTargetable>true</quickTargetable>
      <isTargetable>true</isTargetable>
      <canBeDamagedByAttacks>true</canBeDamagedByAttacks>
      <ai_neverTrashThis>true</ai_neverTrashThis>
      <ai_chillDestination>false</ai_chillDestination>
      <expandHomeArea>false</expandHomeArea>
      <destroyShakeAmount>0</destroyShakeAmount>
    </building>
    <comps>
      <li Class="CompProperties_CascadeOnDestroyed">
        <cascadeCountRange>4~7</cascadeCountRange>
        <cascadeThingDefs>
          <li>VV_RuinCreamWall</li>
        </cascadeThingDefs>
      </li>
    </comps>
  </ThingDef>

